M1  - (Clarkson T.; LeBlanc J.; DeGregorio G.; Vogel-Farley V.; Barnes K.; Kaufmann W.E.; Nelson C.A.) Tessa Clarkson, Jocelyn LeBlanc, Geneva DeGregorio, Vanessa Vogel-Farley, and Katherine Barnes, Boston Children's Hospital, MA; Walter E. Kaufmann, Boston Children's Hospital, MA and Harvard Medical School, Boston, MA; and Charles A. Nelson, Boston Children's Hospital, Harvard Medical School, Boston, and Harvard Graduate School of Education, Boston, MA
T1  - Adapting the Mullen Scales of Early Learning for a Standardized Measure of Development in Children With Rett Syndrome
